<item><g:id>5025101001</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow EFE2000</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow EFE2000 provides 2000Wh of reliable LFP power with 2000W AC output. Designed for demanding environments and extended off-grid use across Kenya.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/efe2000</g:link><g:image_link>https://ueagjjdbbukdkktviyrv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/products/2703a334-6c7d-4b4d-afd6-9a65f3405e46-1781118225601.png</g:image_link><g:availability>out_of_stock</g:availability><g:price>149999.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5025101001</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>5005301008</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow RIVER 2</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow RIVER 2 is the most affordable EcoFlow power station in Kenya. Weighing just 3.5kg with 256Wh capacity and 300W AC output, it&apos;s perfect for camping, travel, and emergency backup.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/river-2</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/ecoflow/river-2.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>out_of_stock</g:availability><g:price>27259.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5005301008</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations</g:product_type></item>
