<item><g:id>5005401025</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow RIVER 2 Max</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow RIVER 2 Max doubles the capacity of the RIVER 2 with 512Wh and 500W output. The perfect portable power companion for camping and small home backup needs in Kenya.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/river-2-max</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/ecoflow/river-2-max.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>out_of_stock</g:availability><g:price>50490.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5005401025</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations</g:product_type></item>
