<item><g:id>EF-DELTA3-CLASSIC</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow DELTA 3 Classic</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow DELTA 3 Classic is EcoFlow’s best-value 1kWh portable power station for Kenyan homes, outdoor work and everyday backup. With 1024Wh LiFePO4 capacity and 1800W AC output (3600W surge, X-Boost to 2400W), it powers essentials like lights, Wi‑Fi, TVs, fridges and power tools. Charges 0–80% in 45 mins via 1400W AC, 500W solar max, 10ms UPS switchover, 5 outlets, whisper-quiet 30dB operation.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/delta-3-classic</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/ecoflow/delta-3-classic.png</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>84379.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>EF-DELTA3-CLASSIC</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations &gt; DELTA Series</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>5005501028</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow RIVER 2 Pro</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow RIVER 2 Pro is the most capable RIVER series power station with 768Wh capacity and 800W AC output. Supports X-Boost technology for powering high-wattage devices.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/river-2-pro</g:link><g:image_link>https://ueagjjdbbukdkktviyrv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/products/9c3fb887-4fa9-4110-8e32-60aa862c4d6c-1780069789344.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>out_of_stock</g:availability><g:price>59049.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5005501028</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>A81H6H21</g:id><g:title>ANKER 322 USB-A TO USB-C CABLE (6FT BRAIDED) WHITE</g:title><g:description>ANKER 322 USB-A TO USB-C CABLE (6FT BRAIDED) WHITE. Product SKU: A81H6H21.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/accessories/anker-a81h6h21-anker-322-usb-a-to-usb-c-cable-6ft-braided-white</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/anker-t2/A81H6H21.jpeg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>580.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>Anker</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>A81H6H21</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Anker &gt; Accessories &gt; Cable</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>5015001024</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow RIVER 3</g:title><g:description>The next-generation EcoFlow RIVER 3 features 245Wh capacity, ultra-fast 10ms UPS switching, and 300W AC output. The most reliable portable power station for sensitive electronics.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/river-3</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/ecoflow/river-3.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>32999.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5015001024</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>5024201005</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow DELTA 3 Ultra</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow DELTA 3 Ultra is the 3072Wh whole-home backup station for bigger Kenyan homes and businesses. With 3600W AC output (7200W surge, X-Boost to 4600W), 10ms UPS auto-switch, 4 charging methods (0-80% in 89 mins via AC), whisper-quiet 25dB operation and OASIS app control with Storm Guard, it keeps fridges, microwaves, office loads and essentials running through long outages.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/delta-3-ultra</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/ecoflow/delta-3-ultra-plus.png</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>250799.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5024201005</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations &gt; DELTA Series</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>5015601028</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow RIVER 3 Plus</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow RIVER 3 Plus delivers 286Wh capacity with 600W AC output and sub-10ms UPS switching. Expandable with extra batteries for extended power on the go.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/river-3-plus</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/ecoflow/river-3-plus.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>41740.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5015601028</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations</g:product_type></item>
