<item><g:id>5004501016</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow DELTA Pro</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow DELTA Pro is a serious home backup battery for Kenyan homes, offices and light commercial setups. With 3600Wh of LiFePO4 storage and 3600W AC output, it runs major appliances during outages, recharges fast, and can be expanded with additional batteries for longer runtime.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/delta-pro</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/ecoflow/delta-pro.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>291399.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5004501016</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations &gt; DELTA Series</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>5013701013</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow DELTA Pro 3</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow DELTA Pro 3 is the premium DELTA model built for demanding backup applications. Its 4096Wh LiFePO4 battery and 4000W AC output make it a strong fit for heavy-duty household backup, offices and small commercial sites that need dependable power when the grid fails.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/delta-pro-3</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/ecoflow/delta-pro-3.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>461799.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5013701013</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations &gt; DELTA Series</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>5020001004</g:id><g:title>EcoFlow E980</g:title><g:description>The EcoFlow E980 offers 1000Wh of reliable power with 1000W AC output, optimised for small business and home office backup in Kenya.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/ecoflow/e980</g:link><g:image_link>https://ueagjjdbbukdkktviyrv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/products/0de7e54a-83a5-40ef-bd78-3768e0aed1a6-1780069878470.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>63799.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>EcoFlow</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>5020001004</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>EcoFlow &gt; Power Stations</g:product_type></item>
