<item><g:id>BLUETTI-HOMESTAR-3</g:id><g:title>Bluetti Homestar 3</g:title><g:description>The Bluetti Homestar 3 is an all-in-one residential backup system with 2.0kW continuous output and 3.01kWh battery storage. A fixed home backup unit — not a portable box — that keeps lights, fridge, WiFi, TV and phone charging running through KPLC outages in Kenya. Installs as part of the house, switches over automatically when the grid drops, and recharges from mains or up to 2000W of solar.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-homestar-3</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-homestar-3.webp</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>111500.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>BLUETTI</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>BLUETTI-HOMESTAR-3</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Bluetti &gt; Power Stations &gt; Residential Backup</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>A3330H11</g:id><g:title>SOUNDCORE C30I BLACK</g:title><g:description>SOUNDCORE C30I BLACK. Product SKU: A3330H11.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/accessories/soundcore-a3330h11-soundcore-c30i-black</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/anker-t2/A3330H11.jpeg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>6720.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>Soundcore</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>A3330H11</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Soundcore &gt; Accessories &gt; In Ear</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>BLUETTI-HV6K</g:id><g:title>Bluetti HV6K Inverter</g:title><g:description>The Bluetti HV6K is a 6.2kW hybrid inverter for residential battery backup in Kenya. Sized for a typical family home — carries the fridge, freezer, lighting circuits, TV, WiFi and a home office together through an outage. Pairs with HB500 5.12kWh battery modules and solar panels (6.5kW max PV), with sub-10ms backup switching.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-hv6k</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-hv6k.png</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>57500.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>BLUETTI</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>BLUETTI-HV6K</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Bluetti &gt; Power Stations &gt; Residential Backup</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>A3947H11</g:id><g:title>SOUNDCORE LIBERTY 4 NC BLACK</g:title><g:description>SOUNDCORE LIBERTY 4 NC BLACK. Product SKU: A3947H11.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/accessories/soundcore-a3947h11-soundcore-liberty-4-nc-black</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/anker-t2/A3947H11.jpeg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>10010.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>Soundcore</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>A3947H11</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Soundcore &gt; Accessories &gt; In Ear</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>BLUETTI-HV10K</g:id><g:title>Bluetti HV10K Inverter</g:title><g:description>The Bluetti HV10K is a 10kW hybrid inverter for whole-house battery backup in Kenya. For large homes and small businesses that need everything on at once — pumps, fridges and freezers, air conditioning, lighting and office equipment. Pairs with HB500 5.12kWh battery modules, accepts up to 14kW of solar, with sub-10ms backup switching.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-hv10k</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-hv10k.png</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>111500.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>BLUETTI</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>BLUETTI-HV10K</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Bluetti &gt; Power Stations &gt; Residential Backup</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>A3947H31</g:id><g:title>SOUNDCORE LIBERTY 4 NC NAVY BLUE</g:title><g:description>SOUNDCORE LIBERTY 4 NC NAVY BLUE. Product SKU: A3947H31.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/accessories/soundcore-a3947h31-soundcore-liberty-4-nc-navy-blue</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/anker-t2/A3947H31.jpeg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>10010.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>Soundcore</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>A3947H31</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Soundcore &gt; Accessories &gt; In Ear</g:product_type></item>
<item><g:id>BLUETTI-HB500</g:id><g:title>Bluetti HB500 Battery</g:title><g:description>The Bluetti HB500 is a 5.12kWh LiFePO4 battery module for HV6K and HV10K residential backup systems in Kenya. One module covers a family home’s essentials for an evening — stack more modules as needs and budget grow. Rated for 6000+ cycles and expandable up to 64 units (327.68kWh max).</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-hb500</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-hb500.png</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>116500.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>BLUETTI</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>BLUETTI-HB500</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Bluetti &gt; Batteries &gt; Residential Backup</g:product_type></item>
