<item><g:id>BLUETTI-BASE-B500</g:id><g:title>Bluetti Base for B500 Battery</g:title><g:description>The Bluetti Base is the mounting base accessory for the Bluetti B500 5kWh battery module. Gives the 50kg battery a stable, secure floor installation as part of an EP760 residential backup system in Kenya. Genuine Bluetti accessory from the authorised dealer.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-base-b500</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-b500.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>11000.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>BLUETTI</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>BLUETTI-BASE-B500</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Bluetti &gt; Accessories &gt; Residential Backup</g:product_type></item>
