<item><g:id>BLUETTI-METER-EP760</g:id><g:title>Bluetti Meter for EP760</g:title><g:description>The Bluetti Meter is the energy meter accessory for the Bluetti EP760 residential backup system. Monitors grid import/export so the EP760 hybrid inverter manages solar, battery and grid power correctly in Kenyan homes. Professional installation recommended. Genuine Bluetti accessory from the authorised dealer.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-meter-ep760</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-ep760.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>6600.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>BLUETTI</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>BLUETTI-METER-EP760</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Bluetti &gt; Accessories &gt; Residential Backup</g:product_type></item>
