<item><g:id>BLUETTI-EMS-EP760</g:id><g:title>Bluetti EMS for EP760</g:title><g:description>The Bluetti EMS is the energy management accessory for the Bluetti EP760 residential backup system. Coordinates the EP760 inverter, B500 batteries and solar input for automated backup and efficient daily use in Kenyan homes. Professional installation recommended. Genuine Bluetti accessory from the authorised dealer.</g:description><g:link>https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-ems-ep760</g:link><g:image_link>https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-ep760.jpg</g:image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>24000.00 KES</g:price><g:brand>BLUETTI</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:mpn>BLUETTI-EMS-EP760</g:mpn><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:product_type>Bluetti &gt; Accessories &gt; Residential Backup</g:product_type></item>
